WEBVTT

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.070
Genbu!

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:48.710
Look!

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:54.670
Max's Genbu has been defeated by
the digital Sacred Beast, and stolen!

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:58.380
But Max fought his very hardest!

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:03.810
And the one waiting for
us on the next floor...

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:07.940
was Salima, whose personality
seems to have changed quite a bit.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:13.690
What happened to her?

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.580
You kept me waiting, Rei Kon.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.960
You're fighting me.
Are you ready?

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.250
Salima...

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:40.340
Are you really the same
Salima I met back there?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.980
Something wrong?

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:52.610
Are you scared, Rei?
After seeing how we took Genbu?

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.860
What?!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.280
What happened to her?

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.860
She's like a different person!

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.240
Her eyes...
they're the same as Jim's!

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:01.820
What?

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:06.330
Has Salima been taken over by
her digital Sacred Beast as well?

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.540
You won't get your
hands on Byakko!

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:13.790
We'll see.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:22.510
Salima... How will your Cyber Driger
fight against Rei's Driger?

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.100
I'm keeping my eyes peeled.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:35.440
Mr. Gideon. During these past few days, Salima has worked hard to evolve her digital Sacred Beast ASAP.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:39.030
I am positive that she will
produce satisfactory results.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:48.490
Rei, you have to win!
Win and get Genbu back!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.540
He's right! You have to win, Rei!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.620
Let's do it!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.670
--Go, Shoot!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.970
That was close...

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.060
Hey! Don't let up!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.730
Go, Driger!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.030
That's it! Keep it up!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.360
You're too soft.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.240
What the hell is Rei doing?!

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.830
His guard is down!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.540
It looks like his
Bey is holding back!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.580
What?!

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.170
Why?! Why won't you
fight me seriously?!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.340
Are you making light of me?!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.350
Then I'll get serious!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.310
Salima's Sacred Beast index is rising rapidly!

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:55.440
It will soon reach
critical rotation!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.360
Yes! Hurry up and
finish him off, Salima!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:03.440
Cyber Driger!!

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.330
There!

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:19.670
Rei! Use Byakko!
Fight back with Byakko!

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:23.210
Rei!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.920
What's wrong?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.300
Summon Byakko, Rei!

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.180
If you don't, it's all over for you!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.440
Salima...

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.070
Will you...

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.240
Forfeit the match?

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.700
No! I can't stop seeing
her face from then!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:54.410
You see... all this isn't what
the whole team wants.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.830
What's the point of battling when you

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:01.590
overwhelm the opponent with pure power
under the manipulation of a Sacred Beast?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.550
I can't fight a battle like that.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:11.510
The Salima I met back then or
the Salima I'm fighting now...

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.810
Which one is the real you?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.810
What are you waiting for?
Summon Byakko! Now!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:21.940
I...

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:23.230
I...!

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.740
Why won't you summon Byakko?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.950
You're gonna lose!

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:31.620
Rei...

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:34.370
Kai...

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.950
Don't be so soft, Rei!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.920
You aren't fighting the old Salima!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.580
Don't waste your
time worrying over it!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:42.840
Kai...

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.170
Look at this.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:51.010
Did you forget what
they did to Max?!

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:55.260
Please... you have to win, Rei!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.140
Byakko!

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.280
Yes! It's Byakko!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:10.860
There it is.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.960
Take him down, Salima!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.970
Finish him off!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:33.970
Bring it on, Byakko!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.930
I'm finishing this, now!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:46.730
Rei!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.150
A draw!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.370
The battle's not over!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:58.700
Damn! Cyber Driger should have
been more powerful of the two.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.040
So why?!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.670
You're a lucky guy, Rei.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:10.720
I'm sure you're aware
that this is a deathmatch.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.180
We fight until one of
us is down for good!

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:29.360
God, this place is rough...

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.190
Isn't there a more normal path, Yusuf?

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.110
My clothes are dirty.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:40.290
If we took the normal path some stupid trap
would've put big gaping holes in our chests.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.620
Are you serious?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:45.620
What's most important
is that we get Genbu back.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.630
Yusuf, are we close?

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.380
Beats me. Either way...

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.380
I'm just going where
my nose knows to go.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.180
This isn't the time for jokes!

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.510
Whoa! Don't move, Dunga!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.930
What are you doing?

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.980
Just watch.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.110
No freakin' way!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.740
The security is getting
stronger, which means...

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.950
We might be getting
closer to Genbu.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:28.290
I will take Byakko this time, for sure!

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.420
Come on, Rei!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:33.880
Wait! Salima, before we battle,
I have one question.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:36.090
Why didn't you show
up that night?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.970
You promised to meet me
at the same place and time.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:42.770
I was waiting all night!

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.360
Why now?

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.740
My mission is to take Byakko!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.280
You're weak, Rei!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.950
Weak?

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.410
No, you're wrong!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:03.830
If you're distracted by that
load of crap, I've already won!

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.460
Hurry up! Get Driger ready!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:09.830
My point is that if you
did show up that night,

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:15.460
I could have prevented you from getting
under the digital Sacred Beast's spell!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:20.300
I hate that I couldn't even do that!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.720
Shut up! No one cares how you feel!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:27.060
I will defeat Byakko
with my Cyber Driger!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.230
Get Driger ready! Now!

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:32.980
Fight, Rei! She can't come
back to her senses!

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.280
She's a Psykick member!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.070
Do you want her
to steal Byakko, Rei?!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.490
What an amusing story that was.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.250
It's you!

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.250
Rei, you cannot defeat Salima.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.460
What was that?!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.420
And do you know why?

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.010
Just as you with Byakko,

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:59.590
Salima is now one with
her digital Sacred Beast.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.800
A fighting machine, if you will.

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:04.970
Trying to fight while
reaching out to a machine

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.850
means you've already lost.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.060
Shut the hell up!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:14.820
Screw you!

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.940
What does he think a Blader is, huh?

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.280
It's so cruel!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:23.450
The fact that a digital Sacred Beast can change
a person like this is what makes them terrifying!

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.780
Okay, now it's on!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:29.040
Salima, I will bring you
back to your senses!

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:30.710
Bring it!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:49.390
Let's go!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.100
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:57.020
Don't lose, Rei!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.280
Come on, Rei!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.280
Take it down, Byakko!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.790
Cyber Driger!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.210
He's totally different now...

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.760
Rei got serious!

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:23.050
Not bad.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.840
I'm just getting started.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:25.970
Take this!

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:31.230
Salima! Wake up!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.520
Silence!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:35.350
Fight back, Cyber Driger!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.740
Both Sacred Beast indexes
are increasing rapidly!

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.370
Cyber Driger should evolve more!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.910
Salima, don't you lose!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.410
Now you've come to fight, Rei.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.250
And now, so will we.

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:56.330
Activate system 505!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.210
Sir!

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:09.970
What the?

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.930
Wind? But we're indoors...

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:12.930
Up there!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.810
Cheating again!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.440
Byakko!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.360
Byakko!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.450
The digital Sacred Beast
is totally fine! But how?

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:32.410
It's a mass of digital code!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.460
It won't take damage
from natural occurrences!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.420
So it's just Byakko?

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:40.130
Go, Cyber Driger!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.220
Rei!

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:56.690
Salima! Until you come to your senses,

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.150
I won't go down!

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.650
Keep it up, Rei! You can do it!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.240
Byakko!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:16.000
Stay out of this!
Shut off the tornadoes, Doctor!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.330
What'd she say to me?

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.920
Well, Doctor?

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.750
Ignore her.
Crank it to full power!

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.800
I just told you to stay out!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:27.170
Go, Cyber Driger!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.090
In the tornado?!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.470
No way!

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:41.060
Cyber Driger's aiming
for the control device!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.030
S-Salima...

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.820
I don't want to use
any of their tricks.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:54.620
I want to fight you on
equal ground. That's all!

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.500
That's it!
That's how you used to be!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.750
How I... Used to be...

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:04.460
Come on, Salima!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.170
My pleasure!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.680
What the hell is Salima thinking?

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.140
What is the matter?

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:20.310
I thought she was supposed to be under the
digital Sacred Beast's complete control.

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:23.440
That's what I thought!
But have no worry--

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.820
There's no going back for Salima!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.030
Meaning?

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:31.110
That is simply how the digital
Sacred Beasts have been programmed.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:34.070
Both Sacred Beast indexes
have surpassed 6,000!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.710
Crap! It evolved again!

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:43.580
Salima!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:52.890
Salima's acting weird!
What's happening to her?

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.260
I don't know.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:16:00.680
I'm positive that the growth of the digital
Sacred Beasts puts an incredible strain on the Blader.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:05.110
So if it keeps evolving,
she'll end up like Yuya...?

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.030
Exactly. It's incredibly dangerous!

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:12.950
Salima!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.740
Go! Sonic Radiation!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.790
Vulcan Claw!

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.590
Salima!

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:42.640
Rei...

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:45.230
I... I...

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:50.820
I remember when we were all traveling
together to learn about battling.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:56.160
Back then, we did our best to
communicate through battles.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.370
Not just to win.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.410
But to have fun battling.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.830
That's it.

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.080
Byakko!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.920
Die!!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.250
S-Salima!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:14.380
She's crazy!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:18.050
It's like she's fighting
something inside of herself...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.770
Salima, you...

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.650
I tried to meet you that night.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.190
With one of the digital Beyblades.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.410
But I couldn't go...

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.160
Back then... I tried to escape...

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.550
So that's why...

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:01.930
Before I knew it, I was drawn in
by the digital Sacred Beast...

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:08.770
Go, Cyber Driger!!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.360
She can't keep this up!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.440
Stop!!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.940
You son of a...

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.780
I-it's strong!

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:21.950
Salima.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:26.160
The thing is, I was worried
about the same thing that night!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:30.420
I didn't see the point
of battling just to win!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.500
But I...

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.210
But in my heart,
I decided to fight my own way!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:42.180
When you fight your hardest and can
communicate without the need for words...

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.890
I must have wanted
something like that.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:47.270
Rei...

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:52.690
We might be similar.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.730
If we hadn't met like this,

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.530
we could understand each other!

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.610
You're finished, Rei!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.070
Salima...

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.950
I will beat you!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.910
While you've regained control!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:13.590
Watch! This is how I battle!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:17.340
Go, Driger!!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.480
Salima!!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:47.830
Impossible!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.960
Cyber Driger exploded!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.050
It's Driger!

00:19:58.260 --> 00:19:59.970
He did it! He won!

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:01.800
I can hardly believe it!

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:07.970
Rei...

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:12.140
Salima...!

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.980
Salima, where are you going?

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.980
Back to my team.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:21.450
Wait! Who's fault do you think this is?

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:25.030
Yeah! You don't have
to go back to them!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:31.830
And now you know how terrifying it is to be
under the power of a digital Sacred Beast, right?

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.250
They're waiting for me.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:38.800
Rei...

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.920
Thank you.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.680
I'm glad I could battle you.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:47.430
Salima...

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.060
Cheer up, Rei.

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:00.690
You took down our
first digital Sacred Beast.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:03.110
You got payback!

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:06.780
But now we definitely
can't forgive Psykick.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:09.530
Yeah! We have to beat them!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:11.120
Right? Kai, Takao?

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.460
Yeah! Leave it to us!

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.790
Right, Kai?

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.460
Absolutely.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:19.670
They won't get away with this.

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:20.750
Yeah!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.630
I will defeat them.

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:02.060
Kai goes into the battle fully-charged

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:05.360
But he lets up midway through the battle.

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:07.990
What's going on in Kai's mind?

00:23:07.990 --> 00:23:11.200
I don't think Kai is particularly mad?

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:12.700
Kai faces Goki.

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:16.950
You two have a good day now, Goki-dokey?

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:20.120
By the way, where did you go, Chairman Daitenji?

00:23:20.120 --> 00:23:21.920
Chairman!
